+plan2_proxy_hsfp_baseline,PLAN-2,2026-07-13,classification,h-sfp,cifar100,configs/proxy/plan2_cifar100_hsfp_baseline.yaml,baseline_hsfp,20260714,e74388c084984e7eaeb3625ce46bff5e37051dac,817f3265d5bec70c72df50cb009c9de5770c8cc660e00418c49d30ca77a7555b,93e523640b9820c12f7cbf570ecb253a8610531942569577831a8b34d822dcb1,e4b67d7d5c12,bounded_proxy,COMPLETE,test_as_val_top1_percent,3.81,outputs/proxy/plan2_cifar100_hsfp_baseline_seed20260714/e4b67d7d5c12/817f3265d5bec70c72df50cb009c9de5770c8cc660e00418c49d30ca77a7555b,docs/optimization_loop/logs/plan2_proxy_20260714_003839/hsfp_baseline.log,"10-round proxy; best epoch 1; validation and test are the same official split; test-as-val and fairness flagged; runtime 3518s launcher/3509.3115s runner"
